      >\n                🎓 سجل الطالب | إدارة أسهل ومتابعة أفضل\n            </h1>\n\n            <p\n                class=\"text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg\n                       text-white/90\n                       leading-8\"\n            >\n                تطبيق من برمجتي يساعد المعلم والإدارة على تنظيم بيانات الطلاب\n                ومتابعة الحضور والدرجات والسلوك والملاحظات من مكان واحد.\n            </p>\n\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n\n    <!-- =========================================================\n         مقدمة\n    ========================================================== -->\n    <section\n        class=\"mb-7 sm:mb-8\n               p-5 sm:p-6\n               rounded-2xl\n               bg-white dark:bg-[#0d1929]\n               border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"\n    >\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-4\">\n\n            <div\n                class=\"shrink-0\n                       w-10 h-10\n                       rounded-xl\n                       bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-950/50\n                       flex items-center justify-center\"\n            >\n                🏫\n            </div>\n\n            <h2\n                class=\"font-black\n                       text-xl sm:text-2xl\n                       text-[#0f3d5e] dark:text-blue-300\"\n            >\n                لماذا أنشأت التطبيق؟\n            </h2>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <div\n            class=\"space-y-3\n                   text-sm sm:text-base md:text-lg\n                   text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300\n                   leading-8\"\n        >\n\n            <p>\n                متابعة الطالب تحتاج إلى أكثر من مجرد حفظ الاسم والصف؛\n                هناك حضور وغياب ودرجات وسلوك وملاحظات وتقارير.\n            </p>\n\n            <p>\n                لذلك صممت\n                <strong class=\"text-[#0f766e] dark:text-teal-400\">\n                    سجل الطالب\n                </strong>\n                ليجمع هذه البيانات في سجل رقمي واحد،\n                مع التركيز على\n                <strong class=\"text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400\">\n                    التنظيم والسرعة والخصوصية\n                </strong>.\n            </p>\n\n        </div>\n\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- =========================================================\n         المزايا\n    ========================================================== -->\n    <section class=\"mb-7 sm:mb-8\">\n\n        <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4\">\n\n            <h2\n                class=\"font-black\n                       text-xl sm:text-2xl\n                       text-slate-900 dark:text-white\"\n            >\n                ✨ أهم المزايا\n            </h2>\n\n            <span\n                class=\"hidden sm:inline-flex\n                       px-3 py-1.5\n                       rounded-full\n                       bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/40\n                       text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300\n                       text-xs font-bold\"\n            >\n                إدارة متكاملة\n            </span>\n\n        </div>\n\n\n        <div\n            class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\n                   gap-3\"\n        >\n\n            <!-- 01 -->\n            <article\n                class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl\n                       bg-white dark:bg-[#0d1929]\n                       border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\n                       transition hover:shadow-md\"\n            >\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n\n                    <span\n                        class=\"shrink-0\n                               w-10 h-10\n                               rounded-xl\n                               bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-950/50\n                               flex items-center justify-center\"\n                    >\n                        👨‍🎓\n                    </span>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-black text-base mb-1\">\n                            إدارة الطلاب\n                        </h3>\n\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-6\">\n                            إضافة وبحث وتصفية ملفات الطلاب.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n\n            <!-- 02 -->\n            <article\n                class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl\n                       bg-white dark:bg-[#0d1929]\n                       border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"\n            >\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n\n                    <span\n                        class=\"shrink-0\n                               w-10 h-10\n                               rounded-xl\n                               bg-teal-100 dark:bg-teal-950/40\n                               flex items-center justify-center\"\n                    >\n                        🏫\n                    </span>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-black text-base mb-1\">\n                            الصفوف والشعب\n                        </h3>\n\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-6\">\n                            تنظيم الصفوف وربط الطلاب بالشعب.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n\n            <!-- 03 -->\n            <article\n                class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl\n                       bg-white dark:bg-[#0d1929]\n                       border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"\n            >\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n\n                    <span\n                        class=\"shrink-0\n                               w-10 h-10\n                               rounded-xl\n                               bg-emerald-100 dark:bg-emerald-950/40\n                               flex items-center justify-center\"\n                    >\n                        📝\n                    </span>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-black text-base mb-1\">\n                            الحضور والغياب\n                        </h3>\n\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-6\">\n                            حضور وغياب وتأخير وأعذار.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n\n            <!-- 04 -->\n            <article\n                class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl\n                       bg-white dark:bg-[#0d1929]\n                       border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"\n            >\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n\n                    <span\n                        class=\"shrink-0\n                               w-10 h-10\n                               rounded-xl\n                               bg-amber-100 dark:bg-amber-950/40\n                               flex items-center justify-center\"\n                    >\n                        📊\n                    </span>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-black text-base mb-1\">\n                            الدرجات والتقييمات\n                        </h3>\n\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-6\">\n                            متابعة الدرجات ومستوى الطالب.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n\n            <!-- 05 -->\n            <article\n                class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl\n                       bg-white dark:bg-[#0d1929]\n                       border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"\n            >\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n\n                    <span\n                        class=\"shrink-0\n                               w-10 h-10\n                               rounded-xl\n                               bg-rose-100 dark:bg-rose-950/40\n                               flex items-center justify-center\"\n                    >\n                        ⭐\n                    </span>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-black text-base mb-1\">\n                            السلوك والنقاط\n                        </h3>\n\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-6\">\n                            متابعة السلوك والإجراءات.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n\n            <!-- 06 -->\n            <article\n                class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl\n                       bg-white dark:bg-[#0d1929]\n                       border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"\n            >\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n\n                    <span\n                        class=\"shrink-0\n                               w-10 h-10\n                               rounded-xl\n                               bg-violet-100 dark:bg-violet-950/40\n                               flex items-center justify-center\"\n                    >\n                        📌\n                    </span>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-black text-base mb-1\">\n                            الملاحظات\n                        </h3>\n\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-6\">\n                            ملاحظات أكاديمية وتربوية.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n\n            <!-- 07 -->\n            <article\n                class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl\n                       bg-white dark:bg-[#0d1929]\n                       border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"\n            >\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n\n                    <span\n                        class=\"shrink-0\n                               w-10 h-10\n                               rounded-xl\n                               bg-sky-100 dark:bg-sky-950/40\n                               flex items-center justify-center\"\n                    >\n                        📥\n                    </span>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-black text-base mb-1\">\n                            استيراد Excel\n                        </h3>\n\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-6\">\n                            استيراد قوائم الطلاب بسهولة.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n\n            <!-- 08 -->\n            <article\n                class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl\n                       bg-white dark:bg-[#0d1929]\n                       border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"\n            >\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n\n                    <span\n                        class=\"shrink-0\n                               w-10 h-10\n                               rounded-xl\n                               bg-orange-100 dark:bg-orange-950/40\n                               flex items-center justify-center\"\n                    >\n                        📤\n                    </span>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-black text-base mb-1\">\n                            التقارير\n                        </h3>\n\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-6\">\n                            تصدير Excel وPDF وJSON.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n\n            <!-- 09 -->\n            <article\n                class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl\n                       bg-white dark:bg-[#0d1929]\n                       border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"\n            >\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n\n                    <span\n                        class=\"shrink-0\n                               w-10 h-10\n                               rounded-xl\n                               bg-red-100 dark:bg-red-950/40\n                               flex items-center justify-center\"\n                    >\n                        🔔\n                    </span>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-black text-base mb-1\">\n                            التنبيهات\n                        </h3>\n\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-6\">\n                            تنبيهات محلية للحالات المهمة.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n\n            <!-- 10 -->\n            <article\n                class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl\n                       bg-white dark:bg-[#0d1929]\n                       border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\n                       sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\"\n            >\n                <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n\n                    <span\n                        class=\"shrink-0\n                               w-10 h-10\n                               rounded-xl\n                               bg-cyan-100 dark:bg-cyan-950/40\n                               flex items-center justify-center\"\n                    >\n                        💾\n                    </span>\n\n                    <div>\n                        <h3 class=\"font-black text-base mb-1\">\n                            النسخ الاحتياطي\n                        </h3>\n\n                        <p class=\"text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 leading-6\">\n                            نسخ واستعادة البيانات.\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </article>\n\n        </div>\n\n\n        <!-- الملف الشامل -->\n        <div\n            class=\"mt-3\n                   p-5\n                   rounded-2xl\n                   bg-gradient-to-l from-[#0f3d5e] to-[#147d83]\n                   text-white\"\n        >\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\">\n\n                <span\n                    class=\"shrink-0\n                           w-11 h-11\n                           rounded-xl\n                           bg-white/15\n                           flex items-center justify-center\"\n                >\n                    📋\n                </span>\n\n                <div>\n\n                    <h3 class=\"font-black text-lg mb-1\">\n                        ملف شامل لكل طالب\n                    </h3>\n\n                    <p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-white/85 leading-7\">\n                        يجمع أهم بيانات الطالب في مكان واحد،\n                        بدل التنقل بين سجلات وملفات متعددة.\n                    </p>\n\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n    </section>\n\n\n    <!-- =========================================================\n         Android / Windows\n    ========================================================== -->\n    <section\n        class=\"mb-7 sm:mb-8\n               rounded-2xl\n               overflow-hidden\n               border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-900/50\"\n    >\n\n        <!-- عنوان القسم -->\n        <div\n            class=\"p-5 sm:p-6\n                   bg-gradient-to-l from-blue-600 to-[#147d83]\n                   text-white\"\n        >\n\n            <div\n                class=\"inline-flex\n                       px-3 py-1.5\n                       mb-3\n                       rounded-full\n                       bg-white/10\n                       border border-white/20\n                       text-xs font-bold\"\n            >\n                🔄 Android ↔ Windows\n            </div>\n\n            <h2\n                class=\"font-black\n                       text-xl sm:text-2xl\n                       mb-2\"\n            >\n                نفس التطبيق على الهاتف والحاسبة\n            </h2>\n\n            <p\n                class=\"text-sm sm:text-base\n                       text-white/85\n                       leading-7\"\n            >\n                نفس الفكرة والميزات الأساسية على Android وWindows،\n                مع إمكانية نقل بياناتك بين الجهازين.\n            </p>\n\n        </div>\n\n\n        <!-- المحتوى -->\n        <div\n            class=\"p-5 sm:p-6\n                   bg-white dark:bg-[#0d1929]\"\n        >\n\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4\">\n\n                <!-- Android -->\n                <article\n                    class=\"p-4 sm:p-5\n                           rounded-2xl\n                           bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#111e30]\n                           border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"\n                >\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\">\n\n                        <div\n                            class=\"w-11 h-11\n                                   rounded-xl\n                                   bg-green-100 dark:bg-green-950/40\n                                   flex items-center justify-center\"\n                        >\n                            📱\n                        </div>\n\n                        <h3 class=\"font-black text-lg\">\n                            Android\n                        </h3>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p\n                        class=\"text-sm sm:text-base\n                               text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\n                               leading-7\"\n                    >\n                        إدارة الطلاب والحضور والدرجات من الهاتف،\n                        مع إمكانية إنشاء نسخة احتياطية للبيانات.\n                    </p>\n\n                </article>\n\n\n                <!-- Windows -->\n                <article\n                    class=\"p-4 sm:p-5\n                           rounded-2xl\n                           bg-slate-50 dark:bg-[#111e30]\n                           border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800\"\n                >\n\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 mb-3\">\n\n                        <div\n                            class=\"w-11 h-11\n                                   rounded-xl\n                                   bg-blue-100 dark:bg-blue-950/40\n                                   flex items-center justify-center\"\n                        >\n                            💻\n                        </div>\n\n                        <h3 class=\"font-black text-lg\">\n                            Windows\n                        </h3>\n\n                    </div>\n\n                    <p\n                        class=\"text-sm sm:text-base\n                               text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400\n                               leading-7\"\n                    >\n                        إدارة البيانات من الحاسبة بشكل مريح،\n                        مع إمكانية استعادة نسخة بيانات الهاتف.\n                    </p>\n\n                </article>\n\n            </div>\n\n\n            <!-- النقل -->\n            <div\n                class=\"mt-4\n                       p-4\n                       rounded-xl\n                       bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/20\n                       border-r-4 border-blue-500\"\n            >\n\n                <h3\n                    class=\"font-black\n                           text-base\n                           text-blue-800 dark:text-blue-300\n                           mb-1\"\n                >\n                    🔄 نقل البيانات بين الأجهزة\n                </h3>\n\n   